---
title: "Music"
blog: tracks
---

<p>Starting to publish some musical sketches I created.</p>

<ul class="article-list">
<% blog(:tracks).articles.each do |piece| %>
  <li>
    <span class="piece-marker">♫</span>
    <%= link_to piece.title, piece %>
    <time datetime="<%= piece.date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') %>"><%= piece.date.strftime('%B, %e, %Y') %></time>
    <% if piece.data.published == false %><sup>Unpublished</sup><% end %>
  </li>
<% end %>
</ul>
